        "worked_solution": "Given two $n\\times n$ matrices $M$ and $N,$ we have\n\n$$\ndet(MN)=det(M)\\cdot det(N).\n$$\n\nIn our case, this gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =det[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{5} & 7 \\\\ 4 & 8\\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}]\\cdot det[\\begin{aligned}3 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =(40-28)\\cdot (6-24) \\\\  & =12\\cdot (-18) \\\\  & =-216.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
